      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Create a request suitable for zero shutter lag still capture. This means means maximizing image quality without compromising preview frame rate. AE/AWB/AF should be on auto mode. This is intended for application-operated ZSL. For device-operated ZSL, use CaptureRequest.CONTROL_ENABLE_ZSL if available. This template is guaranteed to be supported on camera devices that support the PRIVATE_REPROCESSING capability or the YUV_REPROCESSING capability.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/hardware/camera2/CameraDevice#TEMPLATE_ZERO_SHUTTER_LAG" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.hardware.camera2.CameraDevice.TEMPLATE_ZERO_SHUTTER_LAG</code>.</a></format></para>
